OL,3,GNEWSANew hospital car park and access
OL,4,Aroad approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a new car park and access
OL,7,Froad at a West Yorkshire hospital have
OL,8,Fbeen approved.
OL,10,FBradford Council has agreed plans for a
OL,11,Fnew multi-storey car park and access
OL,12,Froad into Airedale Hospital, near
OL,13,FKeighley, with work on the latter
OL,14,Fexpected to begin before the end of the
OL,15,Fyear.
OL,17,FAiredale Hospital is one of seven
OL,18,Fhospitals in England prioritised for a
OL,19,Frebuild due to the use of reinforced
OL,20,Fautoclaved aerated concrete (Raac),
OL,21,Fwhich was found to be unstable and
OL,22,Fprone to collapsing.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
