OL,3,GNEWSANew hospital car park and access
OL,4,Aroad approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FAiredale NHS Trust chief executive
OL,7,FFoluke Ajayi said the new car park
OL,8,Fwould be "a key enabler" in helping
OL,9,Fcreate the space needed to build the
OL,10,Fnew #1.5bn hospital.
